		<description>
			<p style="margin-bottom:5px">This pack contains items that are given to a character of Aberrant Heir Background, if you chose option A for Equipment.</p>
			<p>You will receive following items by extracting contents of this pack:</p>
			<p class="indent">• Dagger</p>
			<p class="indent">• Disguise Kit</p>
